        "native_id": "trz19wmmshrz",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Cloudflare is investigating an issue within the Dashboard UI (Networking \u003e Routes) where the route configuration table is failing to display destination IP addresses/hostnames, connector names, and route descriptions correctly.\n\nActual packet routing, network connectivity across the Cloudflare edge, and API-based route management remain fully operational and unaffected.\n\nOur engineering team is actively working on resolving the underlying rendering issue, and we will provide further updates as soon as more information is available.",
